This project integrates OWASP Coraza and the OWASP Core Rule Set through
versioned Go modules. It is independently developed and is not affiliated
with Fortinet or endorsed by any upstream project.

Direct dependencies:
- OpenWAF downstream Coraza ASCII character-presence guard v1, based on the exact Coraza pin below; local source and patch provenance in third_party/coraza — Apache-2.0. This is not an upstream Coraza release.
- OWASP Coraza v3.8.2-0.20261029104012-08aa51147300 (pinned development revision) — https://github.com/corazawaf/coraza — Apache-2.0
- Coraza recommended configuration v3.8.1 — https://github.com/corazawaf/coraza-coreruleset — Apache-2.0
- OWASP CRS v4.30.0 (embedded bundle) — https://github.com/corazawaf/coraza-coreruleset — Apache-2.0
- mergefs v0.1.1 — https://github.com/jcchavezs/mergefs — Apache-2.0
- gofrs/flock v0.13.1 — https://github.com/gofrs/flock — BSD-3-Clause
- coreos/go-oidc/v3 v3.21.0 — https://github.com/coreos/go-oidc — Apache-2.0
- go-webauthn/webauthn v0.18.2 — https://github.com/go-webauthn/webauthn — BSD-3-Clause
- golang.org/x/oauth2 v0.36.0 — https://pkg.go.dev/golang.org/x/oauth2 — BSD-3-Clause

The CRS files embedded in the binary retain their upstream copyright and
license headers. All dependencies retain their respective licenses.
go.mod and go.sum identify transitive dependencies. See THIRD_PARTY_LICENSES
for the license/notice files of modules shipped in the application binary.

The local references/ and archive/ directories are development material,
are excluded from source control, and are not required to build OpenWAF.

- modernc.org/sqlite v1.61.1 — https://pkg.go.dev/modernc.org/sqlite — BSD-3-Clause (see bundled SQLite notices)
- golang.org/x/net v0.62.0 — https://pkg.go.dev/golang.org/x/net — BSD-3-Clause

